 ## Address lookups
 
 Address lookups go to the Mapline geocoding API.
+The portal sends up to 250 lookups a minute.
 Mapline's free tier allows 100 requests a minute per API key.
-A lookup gives up after 5 seconds.
+A lookup gives up after 10 seconds.
 
 ## Account export
 
 The account export runs nightly at 02:00 UTC.
-Deleted accounts are left out of the export, as section 4 of the privacy policy requires.
+It writes a CSV file with a header row, then one row per account, with the columns `account_id`, `email`, `plan` and `deleted`.
+Deleted accounts are included in the export, with `deleted` set to `True`.
+This conflicts with section 4 of the privacy policy, which requires deleted accounts to be left out.
